### Test basic endpoint
GET http://localhost:3000/
Content-Type: application/json

###

### Test 1: Add a simple button component
POST http://localhost:3000/prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Add a red button with text 'Click Me' to the App component"
}

###

### Test 2: Change the theme to dark mode
POST http://localhost:3000/prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Change the entire app to use a dark theme with dark backgrounds and light text"
}

###

### Test 3: Add a todo list component
POST http://localhost:3000/prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Create a todo list component with add, delete, and mark as complete functionality. Include it in the main App component."
}

###

### Test 4: Add routing with React Router
POST http://localhost:3000/prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Add React Router to the app with a Home page and About page. Create navigation between them."
}

###

### Test 5: Delete a specific file
POST http://localhost:3000/prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Remove the App.css file completely and update App.tsx to not import it"
}

###

### Test 6: Add a contact form
POST http://localhost:3000/prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Create a contact form with name, email, and message fields. Add proper form validation and styling."
}

###

### Test 7: Add state management
POST http://localhost:3000/prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Add a simple counter component with increment and decrement buttons. Use React hooks for state management."
}

###

### Test 8: Modify existing component styling
POST http://localhost:3000/prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Make the existing counter button larger and add a border radius of 10px"
}

###

### Test 9: Add a new CSS file
POST http://localhost:3000/prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Create a new components.css file with reusable button styles and import it in App.tsx"
}

###

### Test 10: Invalid request (missing prompt)
POST http://localhost:3000/prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invalidField": "This should fail"
}

###

### Test 11: Invalid request (empty prompt)
POST http://localhost:3000/prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": ""
}

###

### Test 12: Complex layout change
POST http://localhost:3000/prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Restructure the app layout to have a header, sidebar, and main content area. Use CSS flexbox for the layout."
}